      "at": "2026-11-16T07:51:56.005Z",
      "type": "agent_text",
      "text": "I didn't place an order, because the store can't confirm that any dock under $150 will run two 4K 60 Hz displays from your USB-C laptop.\n\n- **Demo Dock Duo ($129.00):** This is the only one that might work. Its USB-C port check passes. The store hasn't entered how many 4K 60 Hz displays it supports, so I can't confirm it drives two.\n- **Demo Dock Duo Lite ($89.00):** It isn't compatible. It supports only one 4K 60 Hz display.\n- **Demo Dock Solo ($59.00) and Demo Dock Travel ($39.00):** Each supports only one 4K 60 Hz display, so neither can drive two.\n\nThe store is missing the maximum number of 4K 60 Hz displays for the Demo Dock Duo. If the store adds that spec and it shows two or more, I can re-check the dock and get you a quote.\n\nI can also look at docks over $150 if you want to raise your budget."
